      "message": "I prefer the trace_android_vh_scx_ops_enable_state(SCX_OPS_DISABLED); not to be moved inside the scx_ops_enable_mutex lock section. It is because the scx_ops_enable_mutex protects the scx disabling process, and lock release means that the scx ops has already disbaled. So that trace_android_vh_scx_ops_enable_state(SCX_OPS_DISABLED); can be invoked after lock is released.",
